## Overview  
The Living Room Light is a single‑module smart light that can be controlled via the SmartThings ecosystem. It supports basic on/off switching and adjustable brightness.

---

## Capabilities  

| Capability | Commands | Description |
|------------|----------|-------------|
| **switch** | `on`, `off` | Turn the light on or off. |
| **brightness** | `set_brightness` | Set the light’s brightness level. |  

### Brightness Details  
- **Command:** `set_brightness`  
- **Argument:** `level` – an integer value (0‑100) representing the desired brightness percentage.  
- **Example:** `set_brightness(level=75)` sets the light to 75 % brightness.

---

## Quick Start (SmartThings)

```json
{
  "deviceId": "a8ef17a2-5c65-4090-9115-63752630580b",
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "main",
      "capabilities": [
        {
          "id": "switch",
          "commands": {
            "on": {},
            "off": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "brightness",
          "commands": {
            "set_brightness": {
              "arguments": [
                {
                  "name": "level",
                  "schema_": { "type": "integer" }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

*Send the above JSON to your SmartThings hub to control the light.*

---

## Usage Examples  

| Action | SmartThings Command |
|--------|---------------------|
| Turn on | `{"commands":{"on":{}}}` |
| Turn off | `{"commands":{"off":{}}}` |
| Dim to 40 % | `{"commands":{"set_brightness":{"level":40}}}` |

---

## Notes  

- The device is **live** and fully supported in the SmartThings platform.  
- No optional components are available; the main component is mandatory.  

