**Device ID**: `ad654074-cf6b-49a8-9fbf-1d072555360d`  
**Specification Format**: W3C

This device exposes a set of actions that allow you to capture photos, record videos, and control the camera’s orientation, zoom, and focus.

---

## Actions Overview

| Action | Title | Description | Input |
|--------|-------|-------------|-------|
| `takePicture` | Take Picture | Captures a still image. | None |
| `startRecording` | Start Recording | Begins video recording. | `{ "duration": <integer> }` – optional duration in seconds |
| `stopRecording` | Stop Recording | Stops video recording. | None |
| `pan` | Pan | Rotates the camera horizontally. | `{ "angle": <integer> }` – required |
| `tilt` | Tilt | Rotates the camera vertically. | `{ "angle": <integer> }` – required |
| `zoom` | Zoom | Adjusts the camera zoom level. | `{ "level": <integer> }` – required |
| `focus` | Focus | Sets the focus mode. | `{ "mode": <string> }` – required |

> **Note**:  
> - `pan`, `tilt`, `zoom`, and `focus` require the specified property in the input object.  
> - `startRecording` accepts an optional `duration`; if omitted, recording continues until `stopRecording` is called.

---

## Quick Start

```json
// Capture a photo
{ "action": "takePicture" }

// Start recording for 30 seconds
{ "action": "startRecording", "input": { "duration": 30 } }

// Stop recording
{ "action": "stopRecording" }

// Pan right by 45°
{ "action": "pan", "input": { "angle": 45 } }

// Tilt up by 10°
{ "action": "tilt", "input": { "angle": 10 } }

// Zoom to level 3
{ "action": "zoom", "input": { "level": 3 } }

// Set focus to auto mode
{ "action": "focus", "input": { "mode": "auto" } }
```

---

## Getting Help

For detailed information on each action and its parameters, refer to the device’s W3C specification or contact the support team.

