```
51f9eaf4-e4c5-46cd-b1f2-22ef4df0d070
```

## Actions

| Action | Title | Description | Input |
|--------|-------|-------------|-------|
| `turnOn` | Turn On | Turns the light on. | None |
| `turnOff` | Turn Off | Turns the light off. | None |
| `setBrightness` | Set Brightness | Sets the brightness level of the light. | `{ "level": <integer> }` |
| `setColor` | Set Color | Sets the color of the light. | `{ "color": <string> }` |

> **Note**:  
> * `level` is an integer (typically 0–100).  
> * `color` is a string (e.g., `"red"`, `"#FF00FF"`, `"rgb(255,0,255)"`).

## Quick Start

```json
// Turn the light on
{
  "action": "turnOn"
}

