The **TV** device exposes a simple set of actions that can be invoked programmatically.  
All actions are defined in the W3C format and can be called through your preferred integration layer.

## Available Actions

| Action | Description | Input |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| `turnOn` | Turn the TV on. | None |
| `turnOff` | Turn the TV off. | None |
| `setChannel` | Set the TV to a specific channel. | `{ "channel": <integer> }` |
| `setVolume` | Set the TV volume level. | `{ "volume": <integer> }` |

## Example Usage

```json
// Turn the TV on
{
  "action": "turnOn"
}

// Set channel to 5
{
  "action": "setChannel",
  "input": { "channel": 5 }
}

// Set volume to 20
{
  "action": "setVolume",
  "input": { "volume": 20 }
}
```

