This README gives a quick overview of the **TV** device and the actions you can perform on it.  
All actions are defined in the W3C format and identified by the UUID `47884882-8637-4eca-bcf6-843233464f84`.

---

## Overview

| Action | Title | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| `turn_on` | Turn On | Turn on the TV. |
| `turn_off` | Turn Off | Turn off the TV. |
| `set_channel` | Set Channel | Set the TV channel. |
| `set_volume` | Set Volume | Set the TV volume level. |
| `mute` | Mute | Mute the TV audio. |
| `unmute` | Unmute | Unmute the TV audio. |
| `set_input` | Set Input | Set the TV input source. |

---

## Action Details

### 1. `turn_on`
- **Title:** Turn On  
- **Description:** Turn on the TV.

### 2. `turn_off`
- **Title:** Turn Off  
- **Description:** Turn off the TV.

### 3. `set_channel`
- **Title:** Set Channel  
- **Description:** Set the TV channel.  
- **Input Schema:**
  ```json
  {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "channel": { "type": "integer" }
    },
    "required": ["channel"]
  }
  ```

### 4. `set_volume`
- **Title:** Set Volume  
- **Description:** Set the TV volume level.  
- **Input Schema:**
  ```json
  {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "volume": { "type": "integer" }
    },
    "required": ["volume"]
  }
  ```

### 5. `mute`
- **Title:** Mute  
- **Description:** Mute the TV audio.

### 6. `unmute`
- **Title:** Unmute  
- **Description:** Unmute the TV audio.

### 7. `set_input`
- **Title:** Set Input  
- **Description:** Set the TV input source.  
- **Input Schema:**
  ```json
  {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "input_source": { "type": "string" }
    },
    "required": ["input_source"]
  }
  ```

---

## Example Usage

```json
// Turn on the TV
{
  "action": "turn_on"
}

// Set channel to 5
{
  "action": "set_channel",
  "input": { "channel": 5 }
}

// Set volume to 15
{
  "action": "set_volume",
  "input": { "volume": 15 }
}

// Mute the TV
{
  "action": "mute"
}

// Set input to HDMI1
{
  "action": "set_input",
  "input": { "input_source": "HDMI1" }
}
```

