---

## Actions

| Action | Title      | Description                          | Parameters |
|--------|------------|--------------------------------------|------------|
| `play` | Play       | Start playing audio.                 | – |
| `pause`| Pause      | Pause the current audio.             | – |
| `stop` | Stop       | Stop the current audio.              | – |
| `setVolume` | Set Volume | Set the speaker volume. | `volume` (integer) – required |
| `mute` | Mute       | Mute or unmute the speaker.         | – |

---

## Usage

```json
// Start playing
{
  "action": "play"
}

// Pause playback
{
  "action": "pause"
}

// Stop playback
{
  "action": "stop"
}

// Set volume to 75
{
  "action": "setVolume",
  "input": {
    "volume": 75
  }
}

// Toggle mute
{
  "action": "mute"
}
```

