| `turnOff` | Turn Off | Turns the TV off. | None |
| `setChannel` | Set Channel | Sets the TV to a specific channel. | `{ "channel": integer }` |
| `setVolume` | Set Volume | Sets the TV volume. | `{ "volume": integer }` |

> **Note**: The `channel` and `volume` values are expected to be integers. No further validation (e.g., range limits) is specified in this schema.

---

