A simple, programmable TV device that can be controlled via a set of well‑defined actions.

---

## Features

| Action | Title          | Description |
|--------|----------------|-------------|
| `turn_on` | Turn On | Power on the TV. |
| `turn_off` | Turn Off | Power off the TV. |
| `set_channel` | Set Channel | Set the TV to a specific channel number. |
| `adjust_volume` | Adjust Volume | Set the TV volume to a specific level. |

---

