A simple, programmable speaker that can be turned on/off, have its volume adjusted, and play or pause tracks.

---

## Features

| Action | Title | Description | Input |
|--------|-------|-------------|-------|
| `turn_on` | Turn On | Turns the speaker on. | – |
| `turn_off` | Turn Off | Turns the speaker off. | – |
| `set_volume` | Set Volume | Sets the speaker volume. | `level` (integer) |
| `play` | Play | Plays a track on the speaker. | `track` (string) |
| `pause` | Pause | Pauses playback on the speaker. | – |

---

## Usage

```json
// Turn the speaker on
{
  "action": "turn_on"
}

// Set volume to 5
{
  "action": "set_volume",
  "input": { "level": 5 }
}

// Play a track
{
  "action": "play",
  "input": { "track": "favorite_song.mp3" }
}

// Pause playback
{
  "action": "pause"
}

// Turn the speaker off
{
  "action": "turn_off"
}
```

