## Overview
This device represents a simple television set. It can be turned on or off, and its channel and volume can be set programmatically.

## Actions

| Action | Title | Description | Input |
|--------|-------|-------------|-------|
| `turnOn` | Turn On | Turns the TV on. | None |
| `turnOff` | Turn Off | Turns the TV off. | None |
| `setChannel` | Set Channel | Sets the TV channel to the specified channel number. | `{ "channel": <integer> }` |
| `setVolume` | Set Volume | Sets the TV volume to the specified level. | `{ "level": <integer> }` |

## Quick Start

```json
