## Overview

The Light device provides simple on/off control and brightness adjustment. It exposes three actions that can be invoked via your home‑automation platform or any compatible SDK.

---

## Actions

| Action | Title | Description | Input |
|--------|-------|-------------|-------|
| `turn_on` | Turn On | Turns the light on. | None |
| `turn_off` | Turn Off | Turns the light off. | None |
| `set_brightness` | Set Brightness | Sets the brightness level of the light. | ```json<br>{ "level": <integer> }<br>``` |

* `level` – Desired brightness (integer). No other required fields.

---

## Example Usage

```json
// Turn the light on
{
  "action": "turn_on"
}

// Turn the light off
{
  "action": "turn_off"
}

// Set brightness to 75%
{
  "action": "set_brightness",
  "input": {
    "level": 75
  }
}
```

