## Actions

| Action | Title | Description | Input |
|--------|-------|-------------|-------|
| `turn_on` | Turn On | Turns the TV on. | None |
| `turn_off` | Turn Off | Turns the TV off. | None |
| `set_channel` | Set Channel | Sets the TV to a specific channel number. | `{ "channel": <integer> }` |
| `set_volume` | Set Volume | Sets the TV volume to a specified level. | `{ "volume": <integer> }` |
| `play` | Play | Starts or resumes playback on the TV. | None |
| `pause` | Pause | Pauses the current playback on the TV. | None |
| `stop` | Stop | Stops the current playback on the TV. | None |
| `next_track` | Next Track | Skips to the next track in the current media. | None |
| `previous_track` | Previous Track | Returns to the previous track in the current media. | None |

