## Example Usage

```json
// Turn the TV on
{ "action": "turn_on" }

// Set channel to 5
{ "action": "set_channel", "parameters": { "channel": 5 } }

// Set volume to 15
{ "action": "set_volume", "parameters": { "volume": 15 } }

// Play media
{ "action": "play" }

// Pause playback
{ "action": "pause" }

// Skip to next track
{ "action": "next_track" }

// Turn the TV off
{ "action": "turn_off" }
```

---

