A simple, programmable thermostat that can be controlled programmatically via its exposed actions.

## Actions

| Action | Description | Parameters |
|--------|-------------|------------|
| **setTemperature** | Set the target temperature for the thermostat. | `temperature` (integer) |
| **turnOn** | Turn on the thermostat. | – |
| **turnOff** | Turn off the thermostat. | – |
| **setMode** | Set the operating mode of the thermostat. | `mode` (string) |

### Example Calls

```json
// Set temperature to 22°C
{
  "action": "setTemperature",
  "input": {
    "temperature": 22
  }
}

// Turn the thermostat on
{
  "action": "turnOn"
}

// Change mode to "eco"
{
  "action": "setMode",
  "input": {
    "mode": "eco"
  }
}
```

